B.aT=new A.Pa("Home","Post Task","Find Help","Nearby","Tasks","Profile","Cancel","Request","No internet connection. Please check your network.","Featured Helpers","Browse categories","Open tasks near you","See all","No helpers nearby currently.","No other helpers nearby currently.","Tasks Done","Wallet Balance","Settings","Profile","Preferences","Account","Language","Profile Photo","Tap to upload a new photo","Government ID Proof","Full Name","Phone Number","Skills / Qualifications","e.g. Plumber, Driver, Tutor","City","Save Profile Changes","Open for Work","Allow others to find and hire you","Hide from Search","Your profile won't appear in Find Helpers","Join Leaderboard","Show your full name on the public rankings","Logout","Sign out of your account","Delete Account","Permanently remove all your data","Delete Account?","This will permanently delete your account and all associated data. This action cannot be undone.","App Language","Privacy Note",'\u2022 Leaderboard: Only users who have completed at least 1 task can appear. Your full name is shown only if you opt in. Otherwise, only a masked name (e.g. "Ja****") is displayed and your profile cannot be tapped.\n\n\u2022 Hide from Search: When enabled, your profile will not appear in the Find Helpers list even if Open for Work is turned on.',"Profile updated successfully!","Please enter a valid 10-digit phone number.","Uploading photo...","Profile photo updated!","Uploading ID Proof...","ID Proof submitted for verification.","Find Helpers","Available in","No active helpers currently available in your city.","tasks","All","High Rated","My Wallet","Available Balance","Transaction History","No transactions yet","Notifications","No new notifications.","Error loading notifications.","Terms & Conditions","Please read and accept before continuing","Scroll to read all terms","I Accept \u2014 Continue to App","Read All Terms to Continue",'By tapping "I Accept", you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by all of the above Terms & Conditions and Disclaimers.',"\u26a0\ufe0f Important Disclaimer",'Chalbro is a technology platform that connects individuals seeking help with tasks ("Task Posters") and individuals willing to perform such tasks ("Helpers"). Chalbro does NOT employ any Helper and is NOT responsible for the quality, safety, or legality of any task performed through this platform.',"1. Nature of the Platform","Chalbro acts solely as an intermediary marketplace. All agreements for task performance are strictly between Task Posters and Helpers. Chalbro is not a party to any such agreement and makes no guarantees regarding the completion, quality, or outcome of any task.","2. User Eligibility","You must be at least 18 years of age to use this platform. By accepting these terms, you confirm that you are legally capable of entering into binding contracts. If you are under 18, you must not use this app.","3. Safety & Risk Disclaimer","Chalbro does not conduct background checks on all users. Meeting strangers always carries inherent risks. You are solely responsible for your own safety. Chalbro strongly recommends:\n\n\u2022 Always meeting in public places for the first time\n\u2022 Sharing task details with a trusted friend or family member\n\u2022 Reporting suspicious behavior immediately through the app\n\u2022 Never sharing your financial passwords or sensitive personal data\n\nChalbro shall not be liable for any personal injury, death, property damage, or any other harm resulting from interactions between users.","4. Financial Transactions & Wallet","The in-app wallet balance is virtual currency for transactional purposes within the app. All wallet top-ups and withdrawals are subject to applicable taxes and platform fees. A 10% platform fee is deducted from every completed task payment. Chalbro is not liable for any financial loss arising from disputes between users, fraudulent transactions, or platform outages. Wallet balances are non-transferable and non-refundable except as required by applicable law.","5. Prohibited Activities","You agree NOT to use Chalbro for:\n\n\u2022 Any illegal activities\n\u2022 Solicitation of sexual services\n\u2022 Harassment, abuse, or threats of any kind\n\u2022 Posting false or misleading task information\n\u2022 Attempting to conduct transactions outside the platform\n\u2022 Fraudulent reviews or ratings manipulation\n\nViolation of these rules will result in immediate account suspension and may be reported to law enforcement authorities.","6. Identity Verification","You may be required to upload a Government-issued ID for verification purposes. By uploading your ID, you consent to Chalbro storing and processing this data for verification purposes only. Your ID document will not be shared with other users.","7. Privacy Policy","Your personal data (name, phone, city, profile photo) is collected and used solely to provide the Chalbro service. We do not sell your personal data to third parties. Location data (city) is used to match you with nearby tasks and helpers. By accepting these terms, you also consent to our Privacy Policy available at chalbroo.app/privacy.","8. Content & Conduct","You are responsible for all content you post on Chalbro, including task descriptions, messages, and reviews. Chalbro reserves the right to remove any content that violates these terms or is deemed inappropriate at our sole discretion.","9. Limitation of Liability","TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, CHALBRO SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, USE, GOODWILL, OR OTHER INTANGIBLE LOSSES, RESULTING FROM YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SERVICE.","10. Changes to Terms","Chalbro reserves the right to update these Terms & Conditions at any time. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms. We will notify you of significant changes via the app.","11. Governing Law","These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes arising from the use of this platform shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Surat, Gujarat, India.\n\nLast updated: July 2026")
